### One simulation -> 201 Created + Location: /api/simulations/{id}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/taxes/simulation
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"operation": "buy",  "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 10000},
  {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 20.00, "quantity": 5000},
  {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 5.00,  "quantity": 5000}
]

### Batch of simulations (one list per challenge line) -> 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/taxes/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  [
    {"operation": "buy",  "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 100},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 15.00, "quantity": 50},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 15.00, "quantity": 50}
  ],
  [
    {"operation": "buy",  "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 10000},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 20.00, "quantity": 5000},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 5.00,  "quantity": 5000}
  ]
]

### Paginated history (summary)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/simulations?page=0&size=20

### Detail of one simulation
GET http://localhost:8080/api/simulations/1

### Sell larger than the portfolio -> 422 Unprocessable Entity
POST http://localhost:8080/api/taxes/simulation
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"operation": "buy",  "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 100},
  {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 20.00, "quantity": 200}
]

### Unknown operation -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/taxes/simulation
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"operation": "transfer", "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 100}
]
